<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39643" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">purpŭrārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of</i> or <i>belonging to purple</i>,
				<i>purple</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">officinae,</span>”
				<i>manufactories of purple</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 35, 6, 27</span></i>
			,  § 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">46: taberna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					32, 1, 89</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">NEGOTIATOR ARTIS PVRPVRARIAE,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 4250</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Substt.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> ‡ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">purpŭrārĭus</span></b> ,
				ĭi, m., <i>a
				purple-dyer</i>, <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell.
			4271</span></i> and 4272.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> ‡ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">purpŭrārĭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>A purpledye house</i>, <i><span class="en">Inscr.
				Orell. 2952</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>A female dyer in purple</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Act.
				16, 14</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Plur.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Purpŭrārĭae</span></b> ,
				ārum, f. (sc. insulae), <i>two islands in the Atlantic</i>, <i>now Madeira and Porto Santo</i>, Juba ap. <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 32,
				37, § 203</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
